# ─── Version Update Detection ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Injected by buildspec.yml / build.sh at build time.
# PRIMARY check trigger: visibilitychange (user returns to tab) — zero interval calls.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_VERSION_POLL_INTERVAL_MS is the BACKGROUND FALLBACK only (30-min safety net).
